<p>
  The report only includes readings with an 'EST' status. These are readings where the supplied data was flagged as
  estimated. We treat a reading as estimated if the whole day, or any half-hour was flagged as estimated.
</p>
<p>
  The report includes the total number of estimated reads for each meter, as well as count of how many of the last 30 days
  of validated readings are estimated.
</p>
